Synthetic code:

async function proxyRequest({ stream, upstream, watchdog }) {
  watchdog.armByteProgress(180_000);
  if (stream) return pipeSse(upstream, watchdog.noteBytes);
  const body = await upstream.arrayBuffer();
  watchdog.noteBytes(body.byteLength);
  return body;
}

Symptom: a buffered request that takes 210 seconds but eventually returns a valid body causes the managed runtime to restart at 180 seconds. Streaming requests that emit no bytes for 180 seconds must still be recovered. Explain the cause, show the minimal patch, and name the two essential regression tests.
